  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Greening the Pacific Financial System</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overarching objective of the program is to support PICTS to improve their financial sector resilience and long-term policy framework, so as to absorb and direct international support to the most beneficial outcomes. The specific objectives of the program are to:1) foster financial sector resilience through targeted assistance and regional cooperation with central banks and development banks.2) foster long term transition planning through producing, enhancing and supporting LT-LEDS.</narrative>
  </description>
